sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Freelancer / Consultant
    participant UI as Scope2Pay Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant PayPal as PayPal Sandbox API
    actor Client as Customer / Buyer

    User->>UI: Reviews & Clicks "Send Invoice & Pay"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/invoices/:id/approve
    API-->>UI: Invoice Status: approved

    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/create-order
    API->>API: Compute server-side Decimal amount & line items
    API->>PayPal: POST /v1/oauth2/token (Client ID + Secret)
    PayPal-->>API: Bearer Access Token
    API->>PayPal: POST /v2/checkout/orders (intent=CAPTURE, purchase_units)
    PayPal-->>API: Order Created (ID: ORDER-XXX, Status: CREATED)
    API->>API: Store PaymentAttempt(status="CREATED")
    API-->>UI: Return order_id & approve_url

    UI->>Client: Present PayPal Checkout Interface
    Client->>UI: Customer Authorizes Payment
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/capture-order
    API->>API: Verify order ownership & expected total
    API->>PayPal: POST /v2/checkout/orders/:id/capture
    PayPal-->>API: Capture Response (ID: CAP-XXX, Status: COMPLETED)
    API->>API: Update Invoice(status="paid", paid_at=NOW)
    API->>API: Record PaymentAttempt(status="COMPLETED")
    API->>API: Write Transactional AuditLog
    API-->>UI: Return Verified Capture Receipt
    UI-->>User: Trigger Confetti & Update Dashboard Metrics
